:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[MARS PEOPLE (Enemy)]].''
'''MARS PEOPLE''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 4.3 Update|Version 4.3]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Metal Slug Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 221
|rarity = RR
|name1 = MARS PEOPLE
|name2 = MARS PEOPLE CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''MARS PEOPLE CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
While this unit may seem like a slightly stronger anti-[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] version of [[Onmyoji Cat (Rare Cat)|Onmyoji Cat]] with a higher cost, there is one notable difference between the two. MARS PEOPLE has a fast enough attack rate to attack twice in one weaken, greatly increasing its potential uptime. That being said, this doesn't really matter, since most threatening Alien enemies, such as [[Ursamajor]], will outrange it. To make things worse, Onmyoji Cat has a [[True Form]] which makes it about a thousand times better, even against Aliens.

{{Job|Classification = Crowd-Controller}}

